---
// The explorer moved from /mass-school-spending/ to /muni-spending/ on 2026-11-01, when it became the
// municipal spending explorer. This keeps links to the old address working, with their ?d= or ?view=
// selection and any #group; the meta refresh covers browsers without JavaScript. Where the server reads
// public/mass-school-spending/.htaccess, it redirects first and this page is never seen. The list itself moved
// into the explorer's About the data on 2026-11-05 (#216), so this goes straight there.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Moved: Groups and their members</title>
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://timshores.com/muni-spending/?view=data#groups" />
    <script is:inline>location.replace("/muni-spending/?view=data#" + (location.hash.length > 1 ? "group-" + location.hash.slice(1) : "groups"));</script>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/muni-spending/?view=data#groups" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>The groups and their members are now in the explorer, under <a href="/muni-spending/?view=data#groups">About the data</a>.</p>
  </body>
</html>
